msgid "+2 Credits whenever one of your Glass pieces shatters."
msgstr "+2 crédits chaque fois qu'une de vos pièces de verre se brise."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:68
msgid "Breakage Bonus"
msgstr "Prime de casse"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:69
msgid "Insurance Policy"
msgstr "Police d'assurance"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:69
msgid "Once: when you would lose a round, replay it from the start with no free Refresh. Then this card is destroyed."
msgstr "Une fois : quand vous devriez perdre une manche, rejouez-la depuis le début sans relance gratuite. Cette carte est ensuite détruite."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:70
msgid "+2 Mult for each Feat you earn for the first time this round."
msgstr "+2 Mult par exploit obtenu pour la première fois cette manche."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:70
msgid "Showboat"
msgstr "Frimeur"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:71
msgid "+2 Mult when you place while your placements are at their refill cap."
msgstr "+2 Mult quand vous posez alors que vos poses sont à leur plafond de recharge."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:71
msgid "Full Tank"
msgstr "Plein d'essence"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:72
msgid "Overflow"
msgstr "Trop-plein"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:72
msgid "When a line clear would refill past your cap, each wasted refill gives +1 Credit (max 3 per round)."
msgstr "Quand un effacement vous rechargerait au-delà du plafond, chaque recharge perdue donne +1 crédit (max. 3 par manche)."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:73
msgid "Keystone"
msgstr "Clé de voûte"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:73
msgid "x2 Mult when a piece of 1 to 3 blocks clears a line; x4 if it clears two or more."
msgstr "x2 Mult quand une pièce de 1 à 3 blocs efface une ligne ; x4 si elle en efface deux ou plus."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:74
msgid "Clearing a row and a column in the same placement gives you an Eraser (if an item slot is free)."
msgstr "Effacer une rangée et une colonne en une même pose vous donne une Gomme (s'il reste un emplacement d'objet libre)."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:74
msgid "Draftsman"
msgstr "Dessinateur"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:75
msgid "Periscope"
msgstr "Périscope"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:75
msgid "Shows the next three pieces in your draw pile."
msgstr "Montre les trois prochaines pièces de votre pioche."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:76
msgid "Costs 0. When bought: +6 Credits. After each won round, 2 Credits go to repay the loan until 8 are repaid. Cannot be sold until then."
msgstr "Coûte 0. À l'achat : +6 crédits. Après chaque manche gagnée, 2 crédits remboursent le prêt jusqu'à 8 remboursés. Invendable d'ici là."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:76
msgid "Loan Shark"
msgstr "Usurier"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:79
msgid "Gains x0.15 Mult every time two or more lines clear at once. Never resets."
msgstr "Gagne x0.15 Mult chaque fois que deux lignes ou plus s'effacent d'un coup. Ne se réinitialise jamais."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:79
msgid "Snowball"
msgstr "Boule de neige"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:80
msgid "+4 Chips for every line you have cleared this run."
msgstr "+4 Jetons par ligne effacée durant cette partie."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:80
msgid "Tally Counter"
msgstr "Compteur manuel"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:81
msgid "+0.35 Mult for every round won this run."
msgstr "+0.35 Mult par manche gagnée durant cette partie."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:81
msgid "Bonsai"
msgstr "Bonsaï"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:82
msgid "+0.1 Mult for every Credit you hold (max +5)."
msgstr "+0.1 Mult par crédit possédé (max. +5)."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:82
msgid "Coin Pusher"
msgstr "Pousse-pièces"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:83
msgid "Gains x0.3 Mult for each round won without a Refresh or Second Tray. Using one resets it to x1."
msgstr "Gagne x0.3 Mult par manche gagnée sans relance ni Second chevalet. En utiliser un le remet à x1."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:83
msgid "Hot Streak"
msgstr "Série brûlante"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:84
msgid "+1 Mult for each block over 4 in the placed piece."
msgstr "+1 Mult par bloc au-delà de 4 dans la pièce posée."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:84
msgid "Big Game Hunter"
msgstr "Chasseur de gros gibier"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:85
msgid "Rainbow Road"
msgstr "Route arc-en-ciel"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:85
msgid "x1.75 Mult when the board holds all six block colors before the placement."
msgstr "x1.75 Mult quand le plateau contient les six couleurs de bloc avant la pose."

